# 🌐 My Website Project

## 📌 Description

This is my personal website project where I am designing and developing a modern website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## 🚀 Features

* Responsive design
* Clean user interface
* Simple navigation

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

## 📂 Project Structure

* index.html → main page
* style.css → styling
* script.js → functionality

## 🎯 Goal

The goal of this project is to improve my web development skills and build a portfolio.

